---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — PintDownload" description="Privacy Policy for PintDownload Pinterest Media Downloader.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 text-left bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-slate-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6">Last updated: July 23, 2026</p>
    
    <div class="prose max-w-none text-slate-700 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4 font-medium">
      <p>At PintDownload (accessible from https://pintdownload.app), one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information collected and recorded by PintDownload and how we use it.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">No Personal Data Collection</h2>
      <p>PintDownload is a free online utility. We do not require users to register, create accounts, or provide personal information (such as names, emails, or phone numbers) to use our service.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">Log Files</h2>
      <p>Like standard web services, PintDownload logs basic technical metadata (such as IP addresses, browser types, timestamp, and requested URLs) solely for system diagnostic purposes, server performance maintenance, and rate limiting.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
      <p>PintDownload does not use tracking cookies. We utilize browser LocalStorage exclusively to store your 4 most recent download links locally on your device for user convenience.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, feel free to contact us at privacy@pintdownload.app.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
